  "about.html": {
    "page": "about",
    "title": "About · Erasmus+",
    "description": "What the Erasmus+ project United in Diversity, Stronger Through Participation is about, our goals and the people behind it.",
    "main": "<main id=\"main\" class=\"page\">\n  <header class=\"wrap page-head\">\n    <nav class=\"crumbs\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a href=\"index.html\">Home</a><i></i><span aria-current=\"page\">About</span></nav>\n    <h1 class=\"outline page-title\">About</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead\">Three schools from Romania, France and Denmark work together in one Erasmus+ project. Here you can read what it is about and who makes it happen.</p>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"wrap section--tight\">\n    <div class=\"split\">\n      <div class=\"ph\" data-reveal style=\"--px:30%;--py:20%\"><svg class=\"ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"5\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"10\" r=\"1.8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><path d=\"M4 17l5-4.5 3.5 3 3-2.5L20 17\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span>Group photo · all three schools</span></div>\n      <div data-reveal style=\"--d:.08s\">\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">The idea</span>\n        <h2 class=\"h2\">Different places. <span class=\"o\">Same questions.</span></h2>\n        <p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:18px\">Our schools are far from each other. One is near Paris, one is close to the sea in the north of Denmark, and one is in the old town of Brașov, under the mountains.</p>\n        <p class=\"muted\">But our students ask the same questions. How can young people take part in their school and their town? How do we live well together when we are all different? In this project we look for answers together.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"wrap section\">\n    <div class=\"sec-head\" data-reveal><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Goals</span><h2 class=\"h2\">Our <span class=\"o\">goals</span></h2></div></div>\n    <div class=\"grid goals\">\n      <div class=\"glass card goal\" data-reveal><span class=\"n\">01</span><h3 class=\"h3\">Meet and learn together</h3><p class=\"muted\">Students travel to each school, meet new people and work in mixed teams.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"glass card goal\" data-reveal style=\"--d:.08s\"><span class=\"n\">02</span><h3 class=\"h3\">Take part</h3><p class=\"muted\">We learn how young people can have a voice in their school, their town and in Europe.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"glass card goal\" data-reveal style=\"--d:.16s\"><span class=\"n\">03</span><h3 class=\"h3\">Share what we learn</h3><p class=\"muted\">We tell our story on this website: on the map, in the journal and in the gallery.</p></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"wrap section--tight\">\n    <div class=\"sec-head\" data-reveal><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Facts</span><h2 class=\"h2\">Project <span class=\"o\">info</span></h2></div></div>\n    <div class=\"glass info\" id=\"info\" data-reveal></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ASCUNS (hidden). Ca sa apara din nou, sterge cuvantul hidden de pe linia de mai jos. -->\n  <section class=\"wrap section\" hidden>\n    <div class=\"sec-head\" data-reveal><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">People</span><h2 class=\"h2\">Who <span class=\"o\">makes it</span></h2></div><p>The teachers who lead the project in each school, and the students who built this website.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"grid team\" id=\"team\"></div>\n  </section>\n</main>"
  },
