    "title": "The journey · Erasmus+",
    "description": "A map of every Erasmus+ trip, with photos and videos from each place we visited.",
    "main": "<main id=\"main\" class=\"page\">\n  <header class=\"wrap page-head\">\n    <nav class=\"crumbs\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a href=\"index.html\">Home</a><i></i><span aria-current=\"page\">Journey</span></nav>\n    <h1 class=\"outline page-title\">The journey</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead\">Three trips across Europe. Pick a trip to read what it was about, open the learning materials, follow every day on the map and see the results.</p>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"wrap section--tight\" style=\"padding-top:0\">\n    <div class=\"europe-wrap\">\n      <div class=\"glass europe-card\" id=\"europe\" data-reveal></div>\n      <div data-reveal style=\"--d:.08s\">\n        <span class=\"eyebrow\">Three trips</span>\n        <h2 class=\"h2\" style=\"margin-bottom:22px\">Brașov. Orsay. <span class=\"o\">Fjerritslev.</span></h2>\n        <div class=\"mob-list\" id=\"mobList\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"wrap section\" id=\"detail\" style=\"scroll-margin-top:96px\">\n    <div class=\"mob-bar\">\n      <div class=\"seg glass\" id=\"mobTabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Choose a trip\"></div>\n      <p class=\"mob-info\" id=\"mobInfo\"></p>\n    </div>\n    <!-- cele 5 rubrici ale fiecarei mobilitati (aceleasi la toate trei). Continutul lor vine din assets/js/data.js -->\n    <div class=\"hub-bar\"><div class=\"seg glass\" id=\"hubTabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Sections of this trip\"></div></div>\n    <div id=\"hubBody\"></div>\n    <!-- rubrica 3, Daily activities: zilele, harta si locurile -->\n    <div id=\"hubDaily\" hidden>\n      <div class=\"days\" id=\"days\"></div>\n      <div class=\"journey\">\n        <div class=\"glass map-card\" id=\"mapCard\">\n          <div class=\"map\" id=\"map\"></div>\n          <span class=\"map-legend glass\" id=\"mapLegend\"></span>\n          <div class=\"map-box glass\" id=\"mapBox\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"stops\" id=\"stops\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</main>"
