  "legal.html": {
    "page": "legal",
    "title": "Privacy, photos and credits · Erasmus+",
    "description": "Privacy policy, photos and credits for the Erasmus+ project website.",
    "main": "<main id=\"main\" class=\"page\">\n  <header class=\"wrap page-head\">\n    <nav class=\"crumbs\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a href=\"index.html\">Home</a><i></i><span aria-current=\"page\">Legal</span></nav>\n    <h1 class=\"outline page-title\">Legal</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead\">How this website handles your data, how to ask for a photo to be removed, and who made what.</p>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"wrap section--tight\" style=\"padding-top:0\">\n    <div class=\"legal\">\n      <section class=\"glass\" id=\"privacy\" data-reveal>\n        <h2>Privacy policy</h2>\n        <p>This website has no ads, no tracking and no cookies. If you only visit it, we do not collect any personal data about you.</p>\n        <p>The website is hosted by Cloudflare. Like every web host, Cloudflare may keep short technical logs, such as IP addresses, to run and protect the service.</p>\n        <p>The fonts and the design files are stored on this website. There are two exceptions. The maps on the Journey page come from OpenStreetMap, so your browser connects to OpenStreetMap’s servers when you open one of these maps. If a video on this website is embedded from YouTube or Google Drive, it loads from that service.</p>\n      </section>\n      <section class=\"glass\" id=\"upload-data\" data-reveal>\n        <h2>The Upload page</h2>\n        <p>Students and teachers of the project add photos, videos and texts through the Upload page. It is locked with a password. When someone uses it, the website keeps:</p>\n        <ul>\n          <li>The name they type when they sign in. Only the website admin can see it. It is never shown on the public pages. A Journal story shows its author’s name only if the author chooses that.</li>\n          <li>A random access code, saved in their browser, so they do not have to type the password again. It is not a cookie and it is not used for tracking. “Log out” removes it.</li>\n          <li>Which uploads belong to them and when they last used the Upload page.</li>\n          <li>The IP address after a wrong password, to stop people from guessing passwords. It is deleted automatically after 24 hours.</li>\n          <li>The files and texts they upload, with the original file names. Photos are made smaller before they are sent, and this also removes their location data (GPS).</li>\n        </ul>\n        <p>Everyone can edit or delete their own uploads. Deleted uploads stay in a trash folder for 7 days, then they are deleted for good. All of this is stored on Cloudflare’s servers.</p>\n      </section>\n      <section class=\"glass\" id=\"photos\" data-reveal>\n        <h2>Photos</h2>\n        <p>The photos and videos on this website were taken by the students and teachers of the three schools during the project.</p>\n        <p>Are you in a photo and want it removed? Write to <span data-site-email><a href=\"mailto:liceulhonterus@yahoo.com\">liceulhonterus@yahoo.com</a></span> and we will take it down.</p>\n      </section>\n      <section class=\"glass\" id=\"credits\" data-reveal>\n        <h2>Credits</h2>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Design and code: the website team of Colegiul Național „Johannes Honterus”.</li>\n          <li>Logo: Croitoru Andrei.</li>\n          <li>Photos and videos: the students and teachers of the three schools.</li>\n          <li>Hosting: Cloudflare.</li>\n          <li>Intro music: “Flower In A Hurricane” by Justice.</li>\n          <li>Background video on the home page: YouTube.</li>\n          <li>Fonts: Big Shoulders Display and Inter. On the home page also Titan One, Sedgwick Ave Display, Press Start 2P, Fredoka, Abril Fatface, Pacifico, Bungee, Monoton, Lobster, Bangers, Creepster, UnifrakturCook, Righteous, Black Ops One, VT323, Orbitron, Alfa Slab One, Rye, Amatic SC, Cinzel Decorative, Playfair Display, Rubik Mono One, Dancing Script, Shrikhand and Audiowide. All under the SIL Open Font License.</li>\n          <li>Country shapes: Natural Earth (public domain). Maps on the Journey page: © OpenStreetMap contributors, shown with Leaflet.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</main>"
  },
